<title>USA: Rhode Island $36 mln GO bonds restructured.</title>
<headline>Rhode Island $36 mln GO bonds restructured.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber Inc. said Thursday it restructured Rhode Island's $36 million general obligation bond deal, eliminating the 2007 and 2008 maturities.</p>
<p>To see the preliminary pricing, double click on nN19192738.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:  </p>
<p>STATE OF RHODE ISLAND AND PROVIDENCE PLANTATIONS</p>
<p>RE: $35,990,000*</p>
<p>GENERAL OBLIGATION BONDS</p>
<p>CONSOLIDATED CAPITAL DEVELOPMENT LOAN OF 1997,</p>
<p>REFUNDING SERIES</p>
<p>VERBAL AWARD.</p>
<p>TAKEDOWN CHANGE 2004-2007.</p>
<p>THIS ISSUE WILL BE IN BOOK ENTRY FORM THROUGH THE FACILITIES</p>
<p>OF DTC</p>
<p>  MOODY'S: Aaa		 S&amp;P: AAA		   FITCH: AAA</p>
<p>MBIA INSURED</p>
<p>  DATED: 06/15/1997	  FIRST COUPON: 02/01/1998</p>
<p>DUE: 08/01</p>
<p> MATURITY		AMOUNT*    COUPON	   PRICE</p>
<p>08/01/2001    9,630M		5.50  %	  4.40</p>
<p>08/01/2002	220M		4.50  %	  4.50</p>
<p>08/01/2003    5,120M		5.25  %	  4.60</p>
<p>08/01/2004    5,085M		5.00  %	  4.65</p>
<p>08/01/2005    5,045M		5.00  %	  4.70</p>
<p>-----------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>08/01/2006    5,000M		5.00  %	  4.75</p>
<p>08/01/2009    5,890M		5.00  %	100.00</p>
<p>CALL FEATURES: 08/01/2007    101.00</p>
<p>		   DTP 08/01/2009</p>
<p>* - APPROXIMATE SUBJECT TO CHANGE</p>
<p>The bonds will be blue skyed in all states.</p>
<p>The compliance addendum MSRB Rule G-11 will apply.</p>
<p>The award is expected Friday, June 20, 1997.</p>
<p>Delivery is expected on July 8, 1997.</p>
<p>This issue is book entry through DTC.</p>
<p>PaineWebber Incorporated</p>
<p>Prudential Securities Incorporated</p>
<p>Goldman, Sachs &amp; Co.</p>
<p>Artemis Capital Group, Inc.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
